msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Haruta「Gahh～ Think I wore out my throat＿from all that talking～」"
msgstr "Haruta「Aaah～ Creo que se me gastó la＿garganta de tanto hablar～」"

msgid "Kitamura「Alright. Regrettable though it may be,＿let's call it a day.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Muy bien. Por lamentable que＿sea, dejémoslo por hoy.」"

msgid "Ami「It was SUPER fun getting to talk to＿everyone. Invite me again sometime①」"
msgstr "Ami「Fue SÚPER divertido poder hablar con＿todos. Invítenme de nuevo algún día①」"

msgid "Noto「Of course.」"
msgstr "Noto「Por supuesto.」"

msgid "Haruta「Laaaterrr～」"
msgstr "Haruta「Nos veeemos～」"

msgid "Ami「Bye-bye.」"
msgstr "Ami「Adiós.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Takasu, if anything happens, call me＿anytime.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Takasu, si pasa cualquier cosa,＿llámame cuando quieras.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Sure thing.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Claro que sí.」"

msgid "Noto「Let's hang out again soon.」"
msgstr "Noto「Salgamos de nuevo pronto.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Now then......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ahora bien......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Shall we head home, Taiga?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Nos vamos a casa, Taiga?」"

msgid "Taiga「Yeah.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sí.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'm home～」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya llegué～」"

msgid "Taiga「Huh? Yacchan's not here.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Eh? Yacchan no está.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What, she even works on New Year's＿Day?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué, trabaja hasta en＿el día de Año Nuevo?」"

msgid "Taiga「I expected she'd have the day off,＿but......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Esperaba que tuviera el＿día libre, pero......」"

msgid "Taiga「Oh, Ryuuji, she left a note here.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ah, Ryuuji, dejó una nota aquí.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hm...... Let's see here......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Mm...... A ver......」"

msgid "\"Went to a New Year's party downtown.＿Be back later, gator～ Yacchan\""
msgstr "\"Fui a una fiesta de Año Nuevo en el＿centro. Vuelvo más tarde～ Yacchan\""

msgid "Taiga「Then it'll be just the two of us for＿dinner. What'll you make tonight?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Entonces cenaremos solo nosotros dos.＿¿Qué vas a preparar esta noche?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Why would I need to make anything?＿There's plenty of food here.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Para qué tendría que preparar algo?＿Hay un montón de comida aquí.」"

msgid "Taiga「Where is it then?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Y dónde está entonces?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「The leftovers from the New Year's＿meal. There's still leftover rice cakes＿from this morning.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Las sobras de la comida de Año＿Nuevo. Todavía quedan pasteles＿de arroz de esta mañana.」"

msgid "Taiga「Then we'd be eating the same food all＿over again!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Entonces estaríamos comiendo＿lo mismo otra vez!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Not exactly. After all, thanks to the two＿of you, there won't be any shrimp or＿herring roe this time around.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No exactamente. Después de todo, gracias＿a ustedes dos, esta vez no habrá＿camarones ni huevas de arenque.」"

msgid "Taiga「What the hell? Now it's even more＿disappointing!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué diablos? ¡Ahora es todavía＿más decepcionante!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Disappointing for ME! I didn't get a bite＿of those delicacies since you two＿gobbled them up......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Decepcionante para MÍ! No pude probar＿ni un bocado de esas delicias porque＿ustedes dos las devoraron......」"

msgid "Taiga「You didn't get any?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿No probaste nada?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Even black beans and boiled fish paste＿are perfectly good New Year's food.＿But as far as you two are concerned......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Incluso los frijoles negros y la pasta＿de pescado hervida son buena comida de＿Año Nuevo. Pero para ustedes dos......」"

msgid "Taiga「Argh, I get it! I'll eat it, okay? So drop it!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Ya entendí! ¡Me lo comeré! ¡Basta!」"

msgid "Taiga「Thanks for the food.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Gracias por la comida.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Let's eat.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「A comer.」"

msgid "Taiga「Oh, it's delicious...... The black beans go＿surprisingly well with it.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Oh, qué rico...... No esperaba que los＿frijoles negros combinaran tan bien.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I know, right?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Verdad que sí?」"

msgid "Taiga「These kelp rolls are good too.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Qué ricos estos rollitos de alga.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Try the kurikinton.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Prueba el kurikinton.」"

msgid "Taiga「......That reminds me, about earlier, it＿seems you've noticed StuChi's true＿colors, hmm?」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Eso me recuerda, sobre lo de＿antes, parece que ya notaste la＿verdadera cara de Chihuatonta, ¿eh?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「\"StuChi\"? You mean Kawashima?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿\"Chihuatonta\"? ¿Es Kawashima?」"

msgid "Taiga「Yup. Stupid Chihuahua. StuChi for＿short.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sip. Chihuahua Tonta. Chihuatonta＿para abreviar.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Truth is, when I was with her＿yesterday, I was able to remember her＿real self.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「La verdad es que, cuando estuve＿con ella ayer, logré recordar su＿verdadera personalidad.」"

msgid "Taiga「Oh really? Good job, Ryuuji!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Ah, sí? ¡Buen trabajo, Ryuuji!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I gotta admit, that girl's talented～＿Looks like she's got Haruta and Noto＿completely fooled.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Debo admitir que esa chica tiene＿talento～ Parece que tiene a Haruta＿y a Noto completamente engañados.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wonder what would have happened if I＿hadn't remembered......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Me pregunto qué habría pasado si＿no lo hubiera recordado......」"

msgid "Taiga「You're one of StuChi's preferred＿targets, so I'd watch out if I were you.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Eres un blanco favorito de Chihuatonta,＿así que yo que tú tendría cuidado.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I am? Why?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Yo? ¿Por qué?」"

msgid "Taiga「......Because you're stupid.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Porque eres estúpido.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Excuse you.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Oye, más respeto.」"

msgid "Taiga「Well, if you're aware of how she really＿is, then you don't really need my advice＿at this point.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Bueno, si ya sabes cómo es en realidad,＿entonces a estas alturas ya no necesitas＿mis consejos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I gotta say, you two are like oil and＿water. Did something happen?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Debo decir que ustedes dos son como＿el agua y el aceite. ¿Pasó algo?」"

msgid "Taiga「Not really. I just loathe people like her.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No. Solo detesto a la gente como ella.」"

msgid "Taiga「Awww. After all that talk about StuChi,＿the food tastes worse now.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Aaah. Después de hablar tanto de＿Chihuatonta, ahora la comida sabe peor.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「For your information, you're the one＿who brought it up.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Para tu información, tú fuiste＿la que sacó el tema.」"

msgid "Taiga「Really? Anyway, let's drop it.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿De verdad? En fin, dejemos el tema.」"

msgid "Taiga「Guess I should go home now.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Supongo que ya debería irme a casa.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, see you tomorrow.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, nos vemos mañana.」"
